R5w0: "n0" is k4_0=0x18 { n0 = mv1; }
R5w0: "r1" is k4_0=0x11 { r1 = mv1; }
R5w0: "n1" is k4_0=0x19 { n1 = mv1; }
R5w0: "r2" is k4_0=0x12 { r2 = mv1; }
R5w0: "n2" is k4_0=0x1a { n2 = mv1; }
